flowchart LR
    %% Data Sources
    UserEvents[User Events] --> EventCollector
    DatabaseData[Database Data] --> DataLoader
    
    %% Data Ingestion
    EventCollector --> Queue[Event Queue]
    Queue --> UserInteractionService
    DataLoader --> Cache[Cache Layer]
    
    %% Processing
    UserInteractionService --> InteractionRepo[Interaction Repository]
    InteractionRepo --> RecEngine[Recommendation Engine]
    Cache --> RecEngine
    
    %% Repositories that feed the engine
    UserRepo[User Repository] --> RecEngine
    EventRepo[Event Repository] --> RecEngine
    ParticipationRepo[Participation Repository] --> RecEngine
    FriendsRepo[Friends Repository] --> RecEngine
    
    %% Output
    RecEngine --> RecResults[Recommendation Results]
    RecResults --> APIService[API Service]
    RecResults --> NotificationService[Notification Service]